# Emptiness: "if {W}{W} was spent to cast it, return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the
# battlefield." Faithless Looting puts a Llanowar Elves (mana value 1) and an Island into the graveyard; Black Lotus's
# {W}{W}{W} and the Mox Pearl pay the hybrid symbols with white, so {W}{W} was spent, and the Elves return to the
# battlefield untapped (the only legal target, so it is chosen without a question). No black mana was spent, so the second
# ability does not trigger. The control that the mana value is limited to 3 is
# emptiness-white-white-with-only-a-mana-value-four-creature-in-the-graveyard-returns-nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
